        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="entry-content" data-pagefind-meta="excerpt:87. LEIBNIZ AN ANTOINE ARNAULD [Mainz, Anfang November 1671.] Illustri Viro Antonio Arnaldo Gotfredus Guilielmus Leibnitius S.P.D. Quamquam ignoti hominis ad te literas non admodum miras novasque tibi visum iri credam, sueta magnis viris facilitate condonandi quicquid hic liberius peccatur; exponend...">
      <div class="text-content">
